<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired"><h2>What it inspired</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Lin Biao's inscription</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">Cultural Revolution</span><span class="sg-chain-h">quoted the song's words</span></li></ul></section>
<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired-by"><h2>What it drew on</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">I Dedicate Oil to My Motherland (Qin Yongcheng, words by Xue Zhuguo)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">before 1964</span><span class="sg-chain-h">its melody closely resembles the first four lines</span></li></ul></section>
